title: LSP Workspace Symbols

Ctrl+T in VS Code finds a definition or a tiddler anywhere in the wiki by name, through `workspace/symbol`. Try it in [[LSP Workspace Symbols - (Example)]].

!! What is searched

* every definition in the editor's open buffers and in the wiki's `.tid` files
* every definition in a shadow tiddler or a tiddler without a file, which opens as its read-only view
* every tiddler, by its title

A tiddler without a file is only read when its text writes a definition, so the search stays quick on a large wiki.

!! How names are ranked

Names starting with what you typed come first, then names holding its letters in order, the shorter name first within each group. At most 200 come back.